    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Allen & Jacobs is delighted to present this attractive end-of-terrace two-bedroom residence to the market. Ideally positioned on a generous corner site in the heart of Ringsend Village, the property extends to approximately 78 sq. m. and has been thoughtfully extended to both the side and rear by its current owners. A particular feature of the property is the unusually wide rear garden, which benefits from valuable side access and offers excellent potential for further extension or alteration, subject to the necessary planning permissions. The accommodation is bright, well-proportioned and presented in good condition throughout. The ground floor comprises an entrance hall, living room, kitchen rear hall, a bathroom and spacious dining room/family room. Upstairs there are two generous double bedrooms.\nThe combination of the property`s corner position, generous gardens, side access and existing extensions makes this an appealing home with considerable scope for a purchaser looking to add further space or value in the future.\n\nThe location is difficult to beat. Situated in the heart of Ringsend Village, the property is surrounded by an excellent selection of local amenities, including cafés, restaurants, bars, shops and everyday services. Grand Canal Square and Sandymount Village are also within easy walking distance, while the Aviva Stadium adds to the energy and vibrancy of the area. The IFSC, Grand Canal Dock DART station, Ballsbridge, the East-Link and Dublin city centre are all within easy reach, making this an exceptionally convenient location for both city living and commuting. Ringsend Park is just a stone`s throw away and provides an excellent range of recreational facilities, including sports pitches, playgrounds and generous green space.\n\nSpecial Features\nExtended, end of terrace residence in the heart of Dublin 4\n\nWell-presented throughout\n\nLarge side and rear garden\n\nSide access, making any further extensions or alterations much easier and affordable\n\nHeart of Ringsend village\n\nExcellent location close to the city centre\n\nApproximately 78 sq/m of accommodation\n\nGas fired central heating\n\nDouble glazed windows throughout\n\nExcellent public transport \n\nAccommodation\nEntrance hall:\nLiving Room: 4.75m x 3.61m: \nKitchen: 3.61m x 2.47m:\nFamily Room: 8.44m x 4.26m\nRear Hall:\nBathroom: 2.29m x 1.71m: \nBedroom 1: 3.61m x 2.93m: \nBedroom 2: 2.76m x 2.73m: \nOutside\nRear garden with max width of approximately 11m, length of approximately 5m and with side access, offering excellent potential to further extend subject to planning permission.\n\nFloor Area\nApproximately 78 sq/m \n\nViewing\nStrictly by appointment with Allen and Jacobs unless otherwise advertised\n107 Fosters Avenue,\nMount Merrion, Co. Dublin\nt: 2100360 f: 2789494\ne: info@allenandjacobs.ie\nw: allenandjacobs.ie\n\n"
      },
